msgstr "`document_classifier[i]: the page must be an integer, found …`"

#: ../../source/reference/formats/document-classify-python.md
msgid "a page that is not an `int` (a `bool` does not count)"
msgstr "uma página que não é `int` (um `bool` não conta)"

#: ../../source/reference/formats/document-classify-python.md
msgid ""
"`document_classifier[i]: page 0 does not exist (pages are 1-based, "
